  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ea107d3d0fbef947af73792cc9f28a0, type: 3}
  m_Name: BeginningIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueType: 0
  sentences:
  - Cuberts have becomes a massive trend in today's society. You see posts of cuberts
    on social media everyday, which makes you extremely jealous.
  - You really want to buy a cubert, so you look at how much one would cost.
  - $80 for a cubert... You don't have any money. Fortunately, you know about a daycare
    that opened recently and they happen to offer you a role.
  - All you need to do is take care of cuberts for a week and you'll have your own
    cubert! How hard could it be?
